msgstr "Aktiviert / Deaktiviert dieses Zahlungsmodus."

#: ../class-wc-gateway-systempayregroupedother.php:94
msgid "PAYMENT OPTIONS"
msgstr "ZAHLUNGSARTEN"

#: ../class-wc-gateway-systempayregroupedother.php:101
msgid "Regroup payment means"
msgstr "Regroup payment means"

#: ../class-wc-gateway-systempayregroupedother.php:105
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, all the payment means added in this section will "
"be displayed within the same payment submodule."
msgstr ""
"If this option is enabled, all the payment means added in this section will "
"be displayed within the same payment submodule."

#: ../class-wc-gateway-systempayregroupedother.php:110
msgid ""
"Click on « Add » button to configure one or more payment means.<br /"
"><b>Label: </b>The label of the means of payment to display on your site."
"<br /><b>Means of payment: </b>Choose the means of payment you want to "
"propose.<br /><b>Countries: </b>Countries where the means of payment will be "
"available. Leave blank to authorize all countries.<br /><b>Min. amount: </"
"b>Minimum amount to enable the means of payment.<br /><b>Max. amount: </"
"b>Maximum amount to enable the means of payment.<br /><b>Validation mode: </"
"b>If manual is selected, you will have to confirm payments manually in your "
"%s Back Office.<br /><b>Capture delay: </b>The number of days before the "
"bank capture. Enter value only if different from %s general configuration."
"<br /><b>Cart data: </b>If you disable this option, the shopping cart "
"details will not be sent to the gateway. Attention, in some cases, this "
"option has to be enabled. For more information, refer to the module "
"documentation.<br /><b>Do not forget to click on « Save » button to save "
"your modifications.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Auf die Taste \"Hinzufügen\" aufklicken, um ein oder mehrere "
"Zahlungsoptionen aufzubauen.<br /><b>Kennzeichnung: </b>The label of the "
"means of payment to display on your site.<br /><b>Zahlungsmittel: </b>Choose "
"the means of payment you want to propose.<br /><b>Länder: </b>Countries "
"where the means of payment will be available. Leave blank to authorize all "
"countries.<br /><b>Mindestbetrag: </b>Mindestbetrag für die Aktivierung die "
"Zahlungsmittel.<br /><b>Höchstbetrag: </b>Höchstbetrag für die Aktivierung "
"die Zahlungsmittel.<br /><b>Bestätigungsmodus: </b>Bei manueller Eingabe "
"müssen Sie Zahlungen manuell in Ihr %s Back Office bestätigen.<br /"
"><b>Einzugsfrist: </b>Anzahl der Tage bis zum Einzug der Zahlung. Geben Sie "
"Wert nur, wenn anders %s allgemeine Konfiguration.<br /><b>Warenkorb Daten: "
"</b>If you disable this option, the shopping cart details will not be sent "
"to the gateway. Attention, in some cases, this option has to be enabled. For "
"more information, refer to the module documentation.<br /><b>Vergessen Sie "
"nicht, auf die Taste \"Speichern\" zu klicken um Ihre Veränderungen zu "
"speichern.</b>"

