"If you buy subscriptions on your site, choose the solution you use to manage "
"them. At this time only Subscriptio plugin is supported. If you choose "
"\"Custom\", your developper may develop a subscriptions adapter for our "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"If you buy subscriptions on your site, choose the solution you use to manage "
"them. At this time only Subscriptio plugin is supported. If you choose "
"\"Custom\", your developper may develop a subscriptions adapter for our "
"plugin."

